(text "Used for buffering in pipelines, we dont neccessarily want to" (rect 544 320 890 333)(font "DejaVu Sans Condensed" (font_size 8)))
(text "or have to control the enable and clr pins so we set them constant." (rect 544 336 929 349)(font "DejaVu Sans Condensed" (font_size 8)))
(text "On falling edge it stores data to left register on rising edge it stores the left register on the right register" (rect 768 584 1369 597)(font "DejaVu Sans Condensed" (font_size 8)))
(text "this is to seperate the input from output, but on every cycle the data on left gets put on right without inter-bus interference" (rect 768 600 1479 613)(font "DejaVu Sans Condensed" (font_size 8)))
